  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Policy Support for the  Water &lt;(&gt;&amp;&lt;)&gt; Water  related activities - Technical  Advisory  services  for  policy support to the Water, Food Security, Ener</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.    Technical  Advice and organizing round table for a Finance  Strategy for the WASH sector. In collaboration with Ministry of Water Sanitation and Irrigation (MoWSI)  and development partners. 2.    Food Safety: Quick scan, Round Table, indicator validation  workshop. 3.    Climate Diplomacy:  Quick Scan on climate  data availability. 4.    Strategic  planning  (MACS  2022+):  Compiling lessons/best  practices  on Water, Food Security, Energy and Climate from recent evaluations and reviews. 5.    Forensic  Audit environment programme with ACC.</narrative>
  </description>
